    "name": "Version_1_3_0_SolverExternal",
    "description": "Exact version match for a 1.3.0 library. Uses the construct 1.3.0 adds, `solver.external` (esm-spec §2.2.6), so it is also a document an earlier-minor library could not read without a version warning. The referenced run configuration does not exist: EarthSciAST never opens it.",
